# Declared deviations of ooxargs.
#
# A case line written here is a deviation the owner declares: the exit
# code still has to be the same as the upstream tool, but the text of the
# answer may differ. Every other case has to match the upstream tool
# byte for byte.
#
# Write the case line as it stands in qa/parity/cases.oot, with its
# match word in front of it.
